<title>FINLAND: Raisio to expand malt production, exports.</title>
<headline>Raisio to expand malt production, exports.</headline>
<text>
<p>Since Finland has an ample supply of barley, production exceeds domestic demand, Raisio said.</p>
<p>Half of the barley area in Finland is used for growing malt barley varieties.</p>
<p>Raisio said it has malt barley contracts with more than 2,000 farmers.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom + 358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
